{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"tv/95842","tmdb_id":95842,"title":"庆余年","original_title":"庆余年","overview":"某大学文学史专业的学生张庆熟读古典名著，但他用现代观念剖析古代文学史的论文命题不被叶教授所认可。为了让叶教授成为自己的研究生导师，张庆决定通过写小说的方式，进一步阐述自己想要表达的观点。 在他的小说中，身世神秘的少年——范闲，自小跟随奶奶生活在海边小城澹州，随着一位老师的突然造访，他看似平静的生活开始直面重重的危机与考验。在神秘老师和一位蒙眼守护者的指点下，范闲熟识药性药理，修炼霸道真气并精进武艺，而后接连化解了诸多危局。因对身世之谜的好奇，范闲离开澹州，前赴京都。 在京都，范闲饱尝人间冷暖并坚守对正义、良善的坚持，历经家族、江湖、庙堂的种种考验与锤炼，书写了光彩的人生传奇。","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHJvPo9CLpXwX1ncDg6uD0QJIZo.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4eNmWhBfDfAj8qbKHPgW394rAK8.jpg","first_air_date":"2019-11-26","last_air_date":"2024-05-30","year":"2019","episode_run_time":"45 minutes","number_of_episodes":83,"number_of_seasons":3,"tmdb_rating_average":7.966,"tmdb_votes":119,"tmdb_rating":"7.966 / 10 from 119 users","genres":["剧情","喜剧"],"languages":["Mandarin"],"countries":["China"],"production_companies":["Tencent Pictures","Azure Media Corporation 天津深蓝影视","Yuewen Media / Yuewen Film 阅文影视","Xinli TV 新丽电视","CCTV","海南广播电视总台","Tianjin Yuewen Media 天津阅文影视","Tencent Penguin Pictures"],"directors":[{"name":"孙皓","id":1912963}],"producers":[{"name":"张维","id":1864756},{"name":"曹华益","id":2729797},{"name":"龚宇","id":3111282},{"name":"程武","id":2130538},{"name":"孙忠怀","id":2349729}],"cast":[{"id":1675905,"name":"张若昀","original_name":"张若昀","character":"Fan Xian","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/dnNTcRc58ikoJ0JihisgXYTwr75.jpg"},{"id":568304,"name":"李沁","original_name":"李沁","character":"Lin Wan'er","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/thak4pt7jCPbl2xx5HnFhkEE0Tu.jpg"},{"id":1340,"name":"陈道明","original_name":"陈道明","character":"Emperor of Qing","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/xu5PRp6umslrXMvnq0pWsa5LnQh.jpg"},{"id":1086844,"name":"吴刚","original_name":"吴刚","character":"Chen Pingping","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/eUDye599p1edb2rY3UTY88fJO4Y.jpg"},{"id":1569934,"name":"辛芷蕾","original_name":"辛芷蕾","cha